{"_id":"YTIsjsUry0usVgWF","_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","createdTime":1785195999682,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"lastModifiedBy":"TASK47Import0000","modifiedTime":1785195999682,"systemId":"pokerole","systemVersion":"0.8.0"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"systems/pokerole/images/types/water.svg","name":"Soak (Water Type Override)","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":10000,"system":{"description":"<p>Change the Target's Type to Water. (ie Charizard was Fire/Flying, after this Move their Type will be Water) Whole Scene Duration.</p>","source":"Move: Soak","enabled":false,"visible":true,"rules":[{"kind":"type","slot":"type1","newType":"water"},{"kind":"type","slot":"type2","newType":"none"},{"kind":"type","slot":"type3","newType":"none"}]},"type":"effect"}
{"_id":"GpGMCR3e1mLsKRJ2","_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","createdTime":1785195999682,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"lastModifiedBy":"TASK47Import0000","modifiedTime":1785195999682,"systemId":"pokerole","systemVersion":"0.8.0"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"systems/pokerole/images/types/psychic.svg","name":"Magic Powder (Psychic Type Override)","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":20000,"system":{"description":"<p>Change the target's Type to Psychic.</p>","source":"Move: Magic Powder","enabled":false,"visible":true,"rules":[{"kind":"type","slot":"type1","newType":"psychic"},{"kind":"type","slot":"type2","newType":"none"},{"kind":"type","slot":"type3","newType":"none"}]},"type":"effect"}
{"_id":"ifaSi2SoJPPb6oZk","_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","createdTime":1785195999682,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"lastModifiedBy":"TASK47Import0000","modifiedTime":1785195999682,"systemId":"pokerole","systemVersion":"0.8.0"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"systems/pokerole/images/types/grass.svg","name":"Forest's Curse (Add Grass Type)","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":30000,"system":{"description":"<p>Add the Grass Type to the Target's Type. (ie Pikachu will now be 'Electric/Grass' if hit by this) If the Target already has a third Type attached, replace it.</p><p><strong>GM note:</strong> this item defaults to Type 3 - move the rule to Type 2 instead if the target's Type 3 slot already holds their real third type.</p>","source":"Move: Forest's Curse","enabled":false,"visible":true,"rules":[{"kind":"type","slot":"type3","newType":"grass"}]},"type":"effect"}
{"_id":"0wsco9KrHdzjQ5fw","_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","createdTime":1785195999682,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"lastModifiedBy":"TASK47Import0000","modifiedTime":1785195999682,"systemId":"pokerole","systemVersion":"0.8.0"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"systems/pokerole/images/types/ghost.svg","name":"Trick-Or-Treat (Add Ghost Type)","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":40000,"system":{"description":"<p>Add the Ghost Type to the Target's Type. If the Target already has a third Type attached, replace it.</p><p><strong>GM note:</strong> this item defaults to Type 3 - move the rule to Type 2 instead if the target's Type 3 slot already holds their real third type.</p>","source":"Move: Trick-Or-Treat","enabled":false,"visible":true,"rules":[{"kind":"type","slot":"type3","newType":"ghost"}]},"type":"effect"}
{"_id":"IaQlgpGjpw3FHaKH","_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","createdTime":1785195999682,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"lastModifiedBy":"TASK47Import0000","modifiedTime":1785195999682,"systemId":"pokerole","systemVersion":"0.8.0"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"systems/pokerole/images/types/fire.svg","name":"Burn Up (Remove Fire Type)","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":50000,"system":{"description":"<p>After damage is dealt, the user loses its Fire-Type. If its only type was Fire, it is now Typeless. Whole Scene Duration.</p><p><strong>GM note:</strong> this item defaults to clearing Type 1 - move the rule to whichever slot (Type 1/2/3) actually holds Fire on the user. The move's accompanying \"Fire-Type Moves have Power 0\" clause isn't modeled - no rule kind covers move-power reduction.</p>","source":"Move: Burn Up","enabled":false,"visible":true,"rules":[{"kind":"type","slot":"type1","newType":"none"}]},"type":"effect"}
{"_id":"hGQV27jGe91yXp8w","_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","createdTime":1785195999682,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"lastModifiedBy":"TASK47Import0000","modifiedTime":1785195999682,"systemId":"pokerole","systemVersion":"0.8.0"},"effects":[],"flags":{},"folder":null,"img":"systems/pokerole/images/types/electric.svg","name":"Double Shock (Remove Electric Type)","ownership":{"default":0},"sort":60000,"system":{"description":"<p>After damage is dealt, the user loses its Electric-Type. If its only type was Electric, it is now Typeless. Whole Scene Duration.</p><p><strong>GM note:</strong> this item defaults to clearing Type 1 - move the rule to whichever slot (Type 1/2/3) actually holds Electric on the user. The accompanying \"Electric-Type Moves have Power 0\" clause isn't modeled.</p>","source":"Move: Double Shock","enabled":false,"visible":true,"rules":[{"kind":"type","slot":"type1","newType":"none"}]},"type":"effect"}
